  "content": "<p>🤯 LobeHub - Super-Agents on Your Team. Add super-agents to the chats your team already uses.They take on work by themselves and get better every week.</p><p><img alt=\"link\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png\" style=\"margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"20\"/><a href=\"https://lobehub.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://lobehub.com</a></p><hr/><div align=\"center\">\n<a name=\"readme-top\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"https://app.lobehub.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/8beb20539c0fdd1b8fbbc6a07f293a78.webp\"/></a></p>\n<h1>LobeHub</h1>\n<p><strong>Super-Agents on Your Team</strong></p>\n<p>Add super-agents to the chats your team already uses.<br/> They take on work by themselves and get better every week.</p>\n<p><strong>English</strong> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/README.zh-CN.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">简体中文</a> · <a href=\"https://lobehub.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Official Site</a> · <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/changelog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog</a> · <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Documents</a> · <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/blog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blog</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/issues\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feedback</a></p>\n<!-- SHIELD GROUP -->\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/releases\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/lobehub/lobehub?color=3