\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-share%20on%20linkedin-black?labelColor=black&amp;logo=linkedin&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/lobehub?embed=true&amp;utm_source=badge-top-post-badge&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=badge-lobehub-2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"LobeHub - Your Chief Agent Operator for multi-agent work | Product Hunt\" height=\"54\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/top-post-badge.svg?post_id=1147569&amp;theme=light&amp;period=daily&amp;t=1779247564355\" width=\"250\"/></a> <a href=\"https://trendshift.io/repositories/19224\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"lobehub%2Flobehub | Trendshift\" height=\"55\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://trendshift.io/api/badge/repositories/19224\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 55px;\" width=\"250\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vercel.com/oss\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://vercel.com/oss/program-badge.svg?sanitize=true\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<details>\n<kbd>Table of contents</kbd>\n<h4>TOC</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-getting-started--join-our-community\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">👋🏻 Getting Started &amp; Join Our Community</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-features\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">✨ Features</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#from-new-hire-to-one-of-the-team\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">From new hire to one of the team</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#day-1-welcome-to-the-team\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>Day 1</code> Welcome to the team</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#week-1-its-first-task\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>Week 1</code> Its first task</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#month-12-settling-in-as-the-team-grows\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>Month 1–2</code> Settling in as the team grows</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#month-3-it-passes-its-review\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>Month 3</code> It passes its review</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#bring-them-onto-your-team\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bring them onto your team</a></li>\n</ul> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-marketplace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🧩 Marketplace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-documentation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">📖 Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-self-hosting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🛳 Self Hosting</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#a-docker-compose-recommended\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>A</code> Docker Compose (recommended)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#b-one-click-deploy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>B</code> One-click deploy</a></li>\n</ul> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#%EF%B8%8F-local-development\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">⌨️ Local Development</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-contributing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🤝 Contributing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#%EF%B8%8F-sponsor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">❤️ Sponsor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-research\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔬 Research</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4></h4>\n<br/>\n</details>\n<br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a33365f-b786-48b5-9ed6-f8af7927bccb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a33365f-b786-48b5-9ed6-f8af7927bccb</a></p>\n<h2>👋🏻 Getting Started &amp; Join Our Community</h2>\n<p>We are a group of e/acc design-engineers, hoping to provide modern design components and tools for AIGC.</p>\n<p>Whether for users or professional developers, LobeHub will be your AI Agent playground. Please be aware that LobeHub is currently under active development, and feedback is welcome for any <a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/lobehub/lobehub.svg?style=flat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">issues</a> encountered.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/lobehub?launch=lobehub-2&amp;embed=true&amp;utm_source=badge-featured&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=badge-lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/featured.svg?post_id=1065874&amp;theme=light&amp;t=1769347414733\"/></a></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">We are live on Product Hunt! We are thrilled to bring LobeHub to the world. If you believe in a future where humans and agents co-evolve, please support our journey.</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AYFPHvv2jT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1127171173982154893?color=5865F2&amp;label=discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Join our Discord community! This is where you can connect with developers and other enthusiastic users of LobeHub.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important\">\n<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\">\n<svg class=\"octicon octicon-report mr-2\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path>\n</svg>Important</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Star Us</strong>, You will receive all release notifications from GitHub without any delay ~ ⭐️</p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/stargazers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/893e882a8231960b5a729d691b8a40b3.webp\"/></a></p>\n<details>\n<kbd>Star History</kbd>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://api.star-history.com/svg?repos=lobehub%2Flobehub&amp;type=Date\" width=\"100%\"/>\n</details>\n<h2>✨ Features</h2>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<h3>From new hire to one of the team</h3>\n<p>See what Lobe AI gets done, from its first day in your team chat onward.</p>\n<p><sub>WHAT MAKES A SUPER-AGENT</sub></p>\n</div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"> <b>🔌 Flexible access</b><br/> Plug in any IM app, agent or model, all in one place. </td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"> <b>⚡ Parallel work</b><br/> Runs several tasks at once, so you don't have to chase each one. </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"> <b>🙋 Finds its own work</b><br/> Takes on the tasks that suit it, without someone passing messages along. </td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\"> <b>📈 Gets more expert</b><br/> The more you use it, the faster an agent builds up its expertise. </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><code>Day 1</code> Welcome to the team</h3>\n<p>You add it to your team chat and ask it to read up. By lunch it has gone through the history and said hello to everyone.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Before it starts, it reads up\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/ed6fc1ef1e21e4add545c1e83c32fcb4.webp\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Lobe AI's IM Bots settings, its team badge and its Day 1 checklist\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/a1c721a3cbe9cb8ec0f515217322b514.webp\"/></p>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h3><code>Week 1</code> Its first task</h3>\n<p>Someone posts a feature request in Discord and nobody assigns it. Lobe AI takes it on, and you only step in once, to accept the result.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Picks it up: nobody tags it, and it takes the request anyway\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/b0c761a9084a5958d4205e5d056fa3ae.webp\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Hands it in: you check the evidence, accept, and the PR merges\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/b8635a2bf3b600697068d70690a62438.webp\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"Reports back: it replies in the original thread\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/3e187a7e1fd004238163b58e20c59817.webp\"/></p>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h3><code>Month 1–2</code> Settling in as the team grows</h3>\n<p>Everyone now has their own agent, and design, releases and docs each have a dedicated one. Lobe AI is still learning when to speak up and when to stay quiet.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"One brief every morning\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/c4e5bac0c35f840d9476256996e93e49.webp\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"It's learning when to speak up\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/bc065ed83d1ab0862aea98a7216ff787.webp\"/></p>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h3><code>Month 3</code> It passes its review</h3>\n<p>When it started, it got about half of these right. Now it rarely misses, and every correction you gave it has become a lesson it keeps.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"What it has learned\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hub-apac-1.lobeobjects.space/blog/assets/82c6818a9dc6fa27cf5aea75a092b448.webp\"/></p>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<h3>Bring them onto your team</h3>\n<p>Start with one, and add more when you need them.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://app.lobehub.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Try LobeHub Cloud</strong></a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#-self-hosting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Self-host it</strong></a></p>\n<p><img alt=\"enterprise\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff924737-7d3f-410e-a310-d1f44291e7c7\"/></p>\n<p>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:business@lobehub.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">business@lobehub.com</a></p>\n</div>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>🧩 Marketplace</h2>\n<p>Find agents, MCP servers and skills on <a href=\"https://lobehub.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobehub.com</a>, add them to your workspace, or publish your own.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Market</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">What you'll find</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/agent\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>🤖 Agents</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Ready-to-use agents for writing, Q&amp;A, images, video, voice and workflows. Add one to your workspace and adapt it.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/mcp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>🔌 MCP Servers</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">MCP servers rated on activity, stability and community feedback, so you can pick ones you can trust.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/skills\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>🧠 Skills</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Agent skills in the open <code>SKILL.md</code> format. They also work in Claude Code, Codex CLI and ChatGPT.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/icons\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>🎨 AI / LLM Icons</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">A free icon set for major AI brands and models, with SVG, PNG and vector downloads.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Publish your own</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li> <p><strong>Agents</strong>: submit one from its settings in LobeHub. The <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/creator\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Creator Reward Program</a> features a community agent every two weeks.</p> </li>\n<li> <p><strong>MCP servers</strong>: ask your agent to <code>Read https://lobehub.com/publish-mcp/skill.md and follow the instructions to publish my MCP server to the LobeHub Marketplace</code>, or use the CLI:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx -y @lobehub/market-cli login\nnpx -y @lobehub/market-cli plugin submit https://github.com/OWNER/REPOSITORY\n</code></pre> </li>\n<li> <p><strong>Skills</strong>: submit a GitHub repository from the <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/skills\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Skills marketplace</a>.</p> </li>\n</ul>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>📖 Documentation</h2>\n<p>All documentation lives at <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobehub.com/docs</a>:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Section</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">What's covered</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/get-lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Get LobeHub</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Web, macOS, Windows, Linux and mobile apps, and where work runs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/lobe-ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobe AI</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">The built-in agent: chat, code, research and write with no setup</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/agent\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Agents</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">System role, model, skills, connectors, web search, resources and memory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/agent/agent-team\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Team</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Several agents working together: sequential, parallel, iterative or debate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/agent/connect-external-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Connect External Agents</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Bring in Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, Hermes and more, with project context and permissions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/task\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tasks</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Delegate work, track status, follow up in comments, run once or on a schedule</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Memory</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Structured memories you can review, edit and delete</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/page\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pages</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Write long documents with agents, in Markdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/getting-started/resource\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Resource Library</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Documents, generated images and drafts your agents can answer from</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/channels/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Channels</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Your own bots on Discord, Slack, Telegram, LINE, QQ, WeChat, Feishu and Lark</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/messenger/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Messenger</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Chat with your agents through LobeHub's bot on Telegram, Slack, Discord and WeChat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/integrations/github\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Integration</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Track agents' pull requests; merging accepts the work, failed checks go back to the agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/community/overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Marketplace</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Community agents, MCP servers and skills</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/usage/providers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Model Providers</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Setup guides for 40+ providers, inference platforms and local models</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/self-hosting/start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Self-Hosting</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Docker Compose, Vercel and other deployment platforms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/self-hosting/environment-variables\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Environment Variables</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Every configuration option, including model providers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/self-hosting/auth\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Authentication</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Sign-in with Better Auth and SSO providers such as Auth0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/development/start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Development</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Tech stack, local setup and contribution guidelines</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>🛳 Self Hosting</h2>\n<p>Run LobeHub on your own infrastructure and keep your data with you. The full guide is in <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/self-hosting/start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">📘 Build your own LobeHub</a>.</p>\n<h3><code>A</code> Docker Compose (recommended)</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/lobehub/lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/docker/v/lobehub/lobehub?color=369eff&amp;label=docker&amp;labelColor=black&amp;logo=docker&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=flat-square&amp;sort=semver\"/></a> <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/lobehub/lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/docker/image-size/lobehub/lobehub?color=369eff&amp;labelColor=black&amp;style=flat-square&amp;sort=semver\"/></a> <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/lobehub/lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/docker/pulls/lobehub/lobehub?color=45cc11&amp;labelColor=black&amp;style=flat-square&amp;sort=semver\"/></a></p>\n<p>Starts LobeHub with PostgreSQL, Redis, RustFS file storage, SearXNG search and the agent gateway. Runs on Linux and macOS, or on Windows through <a href=\"https://aka.ms/wsl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WSL 2</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">mkdir lobehub &amp;&amp; cd lobehub\nbash &lt;(curl -fsSL https://lobe.li/setup.sh) -l en\ndocker compose up -d\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then open <a href=\"http://localhost:3210\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://localhost:3210</a>. Ports, LAN and domain modes, and upgrades are covered in the <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/self-hosting/platform/docker-compose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">📘 Docker Compose guide</a>.</p>\n<h3><code>B</code> One-click deploy</h3>\n<p>Vercel needs a PostgreSQL database, S3-compatible storage and a few secrets before you deploy. The <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/self-hosting/platform/vercel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">📘 Vercel guide</a> walks through each one.</p>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Deploy with Vercel</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Deploy with Zeabur</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Deploy with Sealos</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Deploy with RepoCloud</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Deploy with Alibaba Cloud</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://vercel.com/new/clone?repository-url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flobehub%2Flobehub&amp;env=APP_URL,DATABASE_URL,KEY_VAULTS_SECRET,AUTH_SECRET,JWKS_KEY&amp;envDescription=Database%2C%20encryption%20and%20sign-in%20variables%20LobeHub%20needs%20on%20Vercel.%20Add%20S3%20storage%20variables%20for%20file%20uploads.&amp;envLink=https%3A%2F%2Flobehub.com%2Fdocs%2Fself-hosting%2Fplatform%2Fvercel&amp;project-name=lobehub&amp;repository-name=lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://vercel.com/button\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zeabur.com/templates/VZGGTI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://zeabur.com/button.svg?sanitize=true\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://template.usw.sealos.io/deploy?templateName=lobehub-db\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/labring-actions/templates/main/Deploy-on-Sealos.svg?sanitize=true\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://repocloud.io/details/?app_id=248\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://d16t0pc4846x52.cloudfront.net/deploylobe.svg?sanitize=true\"/></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://computenest.console.aliyun.com/service/instance/create/default?type=user&amp;ServiceName=LobeHub%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E7%89%88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://service-info-public.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/computenest-en.svg?sanitize=true\"/></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>⌨️ Local Development</h2>\n<p>You can use GitHub Codespaces for online development:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://codespaces.new/lobehub/lobehub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.com/codespaces/badge.svg?sanitize=true\"/></a></p>\n<p>Or clone it for local development:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-fish\">$ git clone https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub.git\n$ cd lobehub\n$ pnpm install\n$ bun run dev       # Full-stack (Next.js + Vite SPA)\n$ bun run dev:spa   # SPA frontend only (port 9876)\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Debug Proxy</strong>: After running <code>dev:spa</code>, the terminal prints a proxy URL like <code>https://app.lobehub.com/_dangerous_local_dev_proxy?debug-host=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A9876</code>. Open it to develop locally against the production backend with HMR — a development convenience, not a place to verify a change.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If you would like to learn more details, please feel free to look at our <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/docs/development/start\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">📘 Development Guide</a>.</p>\n<div align=\"right\">\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lobehub/lobehub/canary/#readme-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-BACK_TO_TOP-151515?style=flat-square\"/></a></p>\n</div>\n<h2>🤝 Contributing</h2>\n<p>Contributions of all types are more than welcome; if you are interested in contributing code, feel free to check out our GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/issues\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Issues</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/projects\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Projects</a> to get stuck in to show us what you're made of.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-tip\">\n<p class=\"markdown-alert-title\">\n<svg class=\"octicon octicon-light-bulb mr-2\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.32.985-2.304 0-2.06-1.637-3.75-4-3.75ZM5.75 12h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM6 15.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z\"></path>\n</svg>Tip</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>We are creating a technology-driven forum, fostering knowledge interaction and the exchange of ideas that may culminate in mutual inspiration and collaborative innovation.</p>\n<p>Help us make LobeHub better. Welcome to provide product design feedback, user experience discussions directly to us.</p>\n<p><strong>Principal Maintainers:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/arvinxx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@arvinxx</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/canisminor1990\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@canisminor1990</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/pulls\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%F0%9F%A4%AF_pr_welcome-%E2%86%92-ffcb47?labelColor=black&amp;style=for-the-badge\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-chat-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%F0%9F%A4%96/%F0%9F%8F%AA_submit_agent-%E2%86%92-c4f042?labelColor=black&amp;style=for-the-badge\"/></a> <a href=\"https://lobehub.com/mcp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%F0%9F%94%8C/%F0%9F%8F%AA_publish_mcp-%E2%86%92-95f3d9?labelColor=black&amp;style=for-the-badge\"/></a></p>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/lobehub/lobehub/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"> <br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=lobehub/lobehub\"/><br/><br/> </th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://next.ossinsight.io/widgets/official/compose-org-active-contributors/thumbnail.png?activity=active&amp;period=past_28_days&amp;owner_id=131470832&amp;repo_ids=643445235&amp;image_size=2x3&amp;color_scheme=light\"/>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-re